      ],
      "text": "Website tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        84.81104278564453,
        110.42239379882812,
        104.31244659423828
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        104.793701171875,
        486.25238037109375,
        163.43360900878906
      ],
      "text": "We could include something about developing disused industrial sites. It\nseems like a good idea because you’re not doing any harm to the natural\nenvironment.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        176.25205993652344,
        111.62239837646484,
        195.75344848632812
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        196.2346954345703,
        395.6615295410156,
        215.03359985351562
      ],
      "text": "Yeah, but aren’t the buildings architecturally significant?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        227.97206115722656,
        110.42239379882812,
        247.47344970703125
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        248.07469177246094,
        517.6439208984375,
        306.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "Not really. And what people forget is that they often used quite dangerous\nmaterials, chemicals and things, which haven’t been properly cleared away, so\nthe whole site has to be made safe.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        319.4110412597656,
        111.62239837646484,
        338.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        339.5146789550781,
        437.6999816894531,
        358.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Hmm, that can't be cheap. And I bet it's often not budgeted for.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        371.2520446777344,
        110.42239379882812,
        390.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        391.23468017578125,
        145.13925170898438,
        410.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "You're right.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        422.85205078125,
        111.62239837646484,
        442.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        442.9546813964844,
        271.4639587402344,
        461.75360107421875
      ],
      "text": "Have you read about Masdar City?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.6920471191406,
        110.42239379882812,
        494.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        494.6746826171875,
        525.8978881835938,
        533.392578125
      ],
      "text": "In Abu Dhabi? Yes. It was designed to be a green city, wasn't it? That might be\na good example of a city which set out to depend entirely on renewable energy.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        546.2110595703125,
        111.62239837646484,
        565.7124633789062
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        566.314697265625,
        471.1080322265625,
        605.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "Yes we should say something about that. It was designed to be totally\npedestrianised too wasn't it with the transport underground.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        617.85205078125,
        110.42239379882812,
        637.3534545898438
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        637.834716796875,
        521.6603393554688,
        676.5526123046875
      ],
      "text": "Yes and they had big plans for recycling to reduce waste to the lowest possible\nlevel. But let's stick to talking about power sources.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        689.4920654296875,
        111.62239837646484,
        708.9934692382812
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        709.4747314453125,
        519.5303955078125,
        748.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Then there's that ecotown in England, Greenhill Abbotts. It set out to conform\nto the usual principles, sustainability and so on. A lot of people were against it\n"
    }
  ]
